<<~ ahu #/entry>>

! A Wide Epoch Weaves Several Inner Methods

The Loom proposes from multiple grammars and numerical emitters, measures
source-specific agreement, checks actual CAD solidity and void routes, and
preserves structurally different valid survivors. A proposal may remain
unscored under finite budget without acquiring a false failure label. An
evaluator may fail without making its candidate physically invalid.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/ooda-ha>>

✶ observe preserved source hashes, location evidence and unresolved geometry
⏿ orient candidate generators to their proper variables, frames and validity guards
◇ decide explicit budgets and reserve legitimate attention for unusual emitters
▶ grow, audit, compare available metrics, archive valid distinct phenotypes, checkpoint
↺ reopen through accepted genomes and retained alternatives, never through a generated image masquerading as external truth

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/aftermaths>>

!! Three Widening Evergreen Apertures

* ''Aperture one — measurement:'' verify original bytes, coordinate transforms and independent landmark controls. Revisit code comments for hidden unit and scale assumptions.
* ''Aperture two — construction:'' verify nameless graph rewrites, geometry operators and no dangling relations. Revisit code comments for claims stronger than exact geometry supports.
* ''Aperture three — house / ecology:'' verify mixed-method budgets, source-anchored checkpoints, alternative niches, operator pet-name release and provenance. Revisit the memetic law for open questions and prohibited shortcuts.

The three loops record consequences, not a ceremonial claim of certainty.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/encoding-identity>>

!! Canonical bytes do not imply common authority

`tools/projection-loom/projection_loom/provenance_encoding.py` SHOULD
provide the one stable JSON SHA-256 encoding for hashed model descriptions:
sorted keys, compact separators, UTF-8, and no forced ASCII escapes.
This is a DRY encoding rule, NOT a single digest for every kind of witness.

Recipe and OODA session identities MUST remain full-length and strict.
Relational descriptors MAY keep their deliberately shortened fingerprints;
location snapshot digests retain their documented existing spelling.
Source-file hashes MUST continue to cover source bytes, not JSON encodings
or output renderings. Neither an identical hash algorithm nor a successful
render certifies structural, polygonal, camera or survey validity.

Any incompatible hash policy or evidence-state change calls for its own
explicitly versioned identity migration and a forked checkpoint, never
silent normalization during a refactor.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/links>>

The active epoch/phase behavior is witnessed by `projection_loom/fractal_ooda_ha.py`, `phase_rules.py` and current tests; the former research notes survive in the pre-burn Git archive. The machine enacts the five phases as a guarded nested runtime controller; developer aftermaths still review our work, not a simulated CAD feature.

<<~/ahu>>

